</section>
<section id="braces" class="band" aria-labelledby="braces-title">
  <h2 id="braces-title">Braces</h2>
  <p>Four pairs. Each holds one slot of a line.</p>
  <div class="qc-grid">
    <article class="qc" id="c-concept">
      <div class="qc-head"><code class="qc-glyph"><span data-t="b-concept">&lt;</span> <span data-t="b-concept">&gt;</span></code><h3 class="qc-name">concept</h3><ul class="qc-badges"><li>brace</li><li>slot: projection</li></ul></div>
      <dl class="qc-facts"><div><dt>reads</dt><dd>Names the kind of thing, outward channel, or domain boundary — can wrap a concept on its own or project outward beside other containers.</dd></div><div><dt>on the shelf</dt><dd>412 lines of 1119</dd></div><div><dt>pressed</dt><dd><code>surfaces<span data-t="b-mode">[</span>route<span data-t="b-mode">]</span><span data-t="b-direction">{</span>path.role<span data-t="b-direction">}</span><span data-t="b-concept">&lt;</span>publish<span data-t="b-concept">&gt;</span></code></dd></div><div><dt>held by</dt><dd><span class="qc-chips"><a href="#c-expression">an expression</a></span></dd></div></dl>
      <p class="qc-links"><a href="/pivot?s=h-projected">Pivot it</a><span aria-hidden="true"> · </span><a href="/physics?line=surfaces%5Broute%5D%7Bpath.role%7D%3Cpublish%3E">Feel it at rest</a><span aria-hidden="true"> · </span><a href="/canvas?s=h-projected">Open it on the canvas</a></p>
    </article>
    <article class="qc" id="c-scene">
      <div class="qc-head"><code class="qc-glyph"><span data-t="b-scene">(</span> <span data-t="b-scene">)</span></code><h3 class="qc-name">scene</h3><ul class="qc-badges"><li>brace</li><li>slot: scope</li></ul></div>
      <dl class="qc-facts"><div><dt>reads</dt><dd>Stages where or when the line happens — before a word, after a body, or alone as an observable midprocess moment.</dd></div><div><dt>on the shelf</dt><dd>127 lines of 1119</dd></div><div><dt>pressed</dt><dd><code><span data-t="b-scene">(</span>look<span data-t="b-scene">)</span><span data-t="b-direction">{</span>stage<span data-t="b-direction">}</span><span data-t="b-concept">&lt;</span>learn<span data-t="b-concept">&gt;</span></code></dd></div><div><dt>held by</dt><dd><span class="qc-chips"><a href="#c-expression">an expression</a></span></dd></div></dl>
      <p class="qc-links"><a href="/pivot?s=r-755c824b">Pivot it</a><span aria-hidden="true"> · </span><a href="/canvas?s=r-755c824b">Open it on the canvas</a></p>
    </article>
    <article class="qc" id="c-mode">
      <div class="qc-head"><code class="qc-glyph"><span data-t="b-mode">[</span> <span data-t="b-mode">]</span></code><h3 class="qc-name">mode</h3><ul class="qc-badges"><li>brace</li><li>slot: mode</li></ul></div>
      <dl class="qc-facts"><div><dt>reads</dt><dd>Selects a stance, variant, or schema coordinate while leaving sibling options visible.</dd></div><div><dt>on the shelf</dt><dd>1058 lines of 1119</dd></div><div><dt>pressed</dt><dd><code>host<span data-t="b-mode">[</span>mode<span data-t="b-mode">]</span><span data-t="b-direction">{</span>one.two.three<span data-t="b-direction">}</span></code></dd></div><div><dt>held by</dt><dd><span class="qc-chips"><a href="#c-expression">an expression</a></span></dd></div></dl>
      <p class="qc-links"><a href="/pivot?s=h-capsule">Pivot it</a><span aria-hidden="true"> · </span><a href="/physics?line=host%5Bmode%5D%7Bone.two.three%7D">Feel it at rest</a><span aria-hidden="true"> · </span><a href="/canvas?s=h-capsule">Open it on the canvas</a></p>
    </article>
    <article class="qc" id="c-definition">
      <div class="qc-head"><code class="qc-glyph"><span data-t="b-direction">{</span> <span data-t="b-direction">}</span></code><h3 class="qc-name">definition</h3><ul class="qc-badges"><li>brace</li><li>slot: body</li></ul></div>
      <dl class="qc-facts"><div><dt>reads</dt><dd>Bounds what lives inside (opening { leans objective, closing } leans subjective): commas hold company, semicolons order stages, ~&gt; relays a path, or nested containers sit inside.</dd></div><div><dt>on the shelf</dt><dd>1102 lines of 1119</dd></div><div><dt>pressed</dt><dd><code>host<span data-t="b-mode">[</span>mode<span data-t="b-mode">]</span><span data-t="b-direction">{</span>one.two.three<span data-t="b-direction">}</span></code></dd></div><div><dt>held by</dt><dd><span class="qc-chips"><a href="#c-expression">an expression</a></span></dd></div><div><dt>holds</dt><dd><span class="qc-chips"><a href="#c-tight">a tight body</a><a href="#c-sequence">a sequence</a><a href="#c-list">a list</a><a href="#c-project-join">a movement</a><a href="#c-nesting">a body inside a body</a></span></dd></div></dl>
      <p class="qc-links"><a href="/pivot?s=h-capsule">Pivot it</a><span aria-hidden="true"> · </span><a href="/physics?line=host%5Bmode%5D%7Bone.two.three%7D">Feel it at rest</a><span aria-hidden="true"> · </span><a href="/canvas?s=h-capsule">Open it on the canvas</a></p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
<section id="marks" class="band" aria-labelledby="marks-title">
  <h2 id="marks-title">Marks</h2>
  <p>Twelve single sigils, named as the workbench names them. A mark reads by where it sits.</p>
  <div class="qc-grid">
    <article class="qc" id="c-potential">
      <div class="qc-head"><code class="qc-glyph"><span data-t="potential">~</span></code><h3 class="qc-name">potential</h3><ul class="qc-badges"><li>mark</li></ul></div>
      <dl class="qc-facts"><div><dt>reads</dt><dd>Holds an uncollapsed path across distance without taking it yet; sits opposite @ perspective, which names who is looking down that thread.</dd></div><div><dt>on the shelf</dt><dd>in front of a word 9; between two lines 27; in front of a part 1</dd></div><div><dt>between lines</dt><dd>the slot reader calls the bond <em>induct</em></dd></div><div><dt>pressed</dt><dd><code><span data-t="potential">~</span>carry<span data-t="b-mode">[</span>register<span data-t="b-mode">]</span><span data-t="b-direction">{</span>loss.less<span data-t="b-direction">}</span></code></dd></div><div><dt>held by</dt><dd><span class="qc-chips"><a href="#c-word">the word</a><a href="#c-project-join">a movement</a><a href="#c-compound">two lines joined</a><a href="#c-citation">a citation</a><a href="#c-reading">a reading beside</a></span></dd></div></dl>
      <p class="qc-links"><a href="/pivot?s=h-induct">Pivot it</a><span aria-hidden="true"> · </span><a href="/physics?line=~carry%5Bregister%5D%7Bloss.less%7D">Feel it at rest</a><span aria-hidden="true"> · </span><a href="/canvas?s=h-induct">Open it on the canvas</a></p>
    </article>
    <article class="qc" id="c-wonder">
      <div class="qc-head"><code class="qc-glyph"><span data-t="wonder">?</span></code><h3 class="qc-name">wonder</h3><ul class="qc-badges"><li>mark</li></ul></div>
      <dl class="qc-facts"><div><dt>reads</dt><dd>Opens an inquiry or conditional gate without forcing closure; balances ! action, which collapses possibility into an observable move.</dd></div><div><dt>on the shelf</dt><dd>in front of a word 10; in front of a part 1</dd></div><div><dt>pressed</dt><dd><code><span data-t="wonder">?</span>atlas<span data-t="b-mode">[</span>open<span data-t="b-mode">]</span><span data-t="b-direction">{</span>aperture.edge<span data-t="b-direction">}</span></code></dd></div><div><dt>held by</dt><dd><span class="qc-chips"><a href="#c-word">the word</a></span></dd></div></dl>
      <p class="qc-links"><a href="/pivot?s=h-probe">Pivot it</a><span aria-hidden="true"> · </span><a href="/physics?line=%3Fatlas%5Bopen%5D%7Baperture.edge%7D">Feel it at rest</a><span aria-hidden="true"> · </span><a href="/canvas?s=h-probe">Open it on the canvas</a></p>
    </article>
    <article class="qc" id="c-action">
      <div class="qc-head"><code class="qc-glyph"><span data-t="action">!</span></code><h3 class="qc-name">action</h3><ul class="qc-badges"><li>mark</li></ul></div>
      <dl class="qc-facts"><div><dt>reads</dt><dd>Commits a state change so its consequence becomes observable; completes ? wonder by crossing from inquiry into effect.</dd></div><div><dt>on the shelf</dt><dd>in front of a word 3; in front of a part 1</dd></div></dl>
    </article>
    <article class="qc" id="c-value">
      <div class="qc-head"><code class="qc-glyph"><span data-t="value">*</span></code><h3 class="qc-name">value</h3><ul class="qc-badges"><li>mark</li></ul></div>
      <dl class="qc-facts"><div><dt>reads</dt><dd>Materializes what carries concrete worth or salience here; pairs with $ substrate, which names the physical cost or ground carrying it.</dd></div><div><dt>on the shelf</dt><dd>in front of a word 2</dd></div></dl>
    </article>
    <article class="qc" id="c-ground">
      <div class="qc-head"><code class="qc-glyph"><span data-t="ground">.</span></code><h3 class="qc-name">ground</h3><ul class="qc-badges"><li>mark</li></ul></div>
      <dl class="qc-facts"><div><dt>reads</dt><dd>Settles attention back to the local default or center of gravity; anchors # vibration, which projects an address outward so others can find it.</dd></div><div><dt>on the shelf</dt><dd>after a word 1</dd></div><div><dt>pressed</dt><dd><code>orientation<span data-t="ground">.</span></code></dd></div></dl>
      <p class="qc-links"><a href="/pivot?s=h-settle">Pivot it</a><span aria-hidden="true"> · </span><a href="/canvas?s=h-settle">Open it on the canvas</a></p>
    </article>
    <article class="qc" id="c-ascension">
      <div class="qc-head"><code class="qc-glyph"><span data-t="integration">^</span></code><h3 class="qc-name">ascension</h3><ul class="qc-badges"><li>mark</li></ul></div>
      <dl class="qc-facts"><div><dt>reads</dt><dd>Lifts separate parts onto a higher register as one inspectable whole; complements &amp; subject, which binds parallel streams laterally.</dd></div><div><dt>on the shelf</dt><dd>in front of a word 8; between two lines 1</dd></div><div><dt>between lines</dt><dd>the slot reader calls the bond <em>project</em></dd></div><div><dt>pressed</dt><dd><code><span data-t="integration">^</span>lift<span data-t="b-mode">[</span>evidence<span data-t="b-mode">]</span><span data-t="b-direction">{</span>parts.whole<span data-t="b-direction">}</span></code></dd></div><div><dt>held by</dt><dd><span class="qc-chips"><a href="#c-word">the word</a><a href="#c-compound">two lines joined</a></span></dd></div></dl>
      <p class="qc-links"><a href="/pivot?s=h-project">Pivot it</a><span aria-hidden="true"> · </span><a href="/physics?line=%5Elift%5Bevidence%5D%7Bparts.whole%7D">Feel it at rest</a><span aria-hidden="true"> · </span><a href="/canvas?s=h-project">Open it on the canvas</a></p>
    </article>
    <article class="qc" id="c-vibration">
      <div class="qc-head"><code class="qc-glyph"><span data-t="vibration">#</span></code><h3 class="qc-name">vibration</h3><ul class="qc-badges"><li>mark</li></ul></div>
      <dl class="qc-facts"><div><dt>reads</dt><dd>Calls a structure by resonant name (#&gt;, #:, #!) so tools and readers can address or echo it across files; balances . ground.</dd></div><div><dt>on the shelf</dt><dd>in front of a word 55</dd></div><div><dt>pressed</dt><dd><code><span data-t="frame">#&gt;site</span><span data-t="b-direction">{</span>route.surface<span data-t="b-direction">}</span></code></dd></div><div><dt>held by</dt><dd><span class="qc-chips"><a href="#c-word">the word</a><a href="#c-frame-address">a frame address</a><a href="#c-layer">a layer</a><a href="#c-reading">a reading beside</a></span></dd></div></dl>
      <p class="qc-links"><a href="/pivot?s=h-ground">Pivot it</a><span aria-hidden="true"> · </span><a href="/canvas?s=h-ground">Open it on the canvas</a></p>
    </article>
    <article class="qc" id="c-perspective">
      <div class="qc-head"><code class="qc-glyph"><span data-t="perspective">@</span></code><h3 class="qc-name">perspective</h3><ul class="qc-badges"><li>mark</li></ul></div>
      <dl class="qc-facts"><div><dt>reads</dt><dd>Situates the coordinate origin — who or what is looking (Persona@subject, @alias) — giving ~ potential a vantage point to aim from.</dd></div><div><dt>on the shelf</dt><dd>in front of a word 5; inside a word 9</dd></div><div><dt>between lines</dt><dd>the slot reader calls the bond <em>perspective</em></dd></div><div><dt>pressed</dt><dd><code><span data-t="perspective">viewer</span><span data-t="perspective">@</span>subject</code></dd></div><div><dt>held by</dt><dd><span class="qc-chips"><a href="#c-compound">two lines joined</a><a href="#c-handle">a handle</a></span></dd></div></dl>
      <p class="qc-links"><a href="/pivot?s=h-lens_bare">Pivot it</a><span aria-hidden="true"> · </span><a href="/canvas?s=h-lens_bare">Open it on the canvas</a></p>
    </article>
    <article class="qc" id="c-subject">
